01:39:08,310 --> 01:39:08,730
[SPEAKER_01] grijehu.

1535
01:39:09,150 --> 01:39:10,530
[SPEAKER_00] But it rejoices with the truth.

1536
01:39:10,770 --> 01:39:11,610
[SPEAKER_01] Raduje se istini.

1537
01:39:13,170 --> 01:39:14,070
[SPEAKER_00] Here's our last one.

1538
01:39:14,430 --> 01:39:15,090
[SPEAKER_01] Evo zadnje.

1539
01:39:15,570 --> 01:39:17,730
[SPEAKER_00] Love bears all things.

1540
01:39:17,910 --> 01:39:18,990
[SPEAKER_01] Ljubav sve podnosi.

1541
01:39:19,410 --> 01:39:20,490
[SPEAKER_00] Believes all things.

1542
01:39:20,910 --> 01:39:21,630
[SPEAKER_01] Svemu vjeruje.

1543
01:39:22,050 --> 01:39:23,070
[SPEAKER_00] Hopes all things.

1544
01:39:23,250 --> 01:39:24,810
[SPEAKER_01] Sve pokriva, svemu se nada.

1545
01:39:25,050 --> 01:39:25,950
[SPEAKER_00] Endures all things.

1546
01:39:26,190 --> 01:39:26,850
[SPEAKER_01] Sve podnosi.

1547
01:39:27,570 --> 01:39:30,750
[SPEAKER_00] So go ahead and declare this, "I bear all things."

1548
01:39:30,930 --> 01:39:32,010
[SPEAKER_01] Ja sve pokrivam.

1549
01:39:33,930 --> 01:39:34,770
[SPEAKER_00] I believe all things.

1550
01:39:34,890 --> 01:39:35,490
[SPEAKER_01] Svemu vjerujem.

1551
01:39:36,990 --> 01:39:37,470
[SPEAKER_00] I hope all

1552
01:39:37,530 --> 01:39:38,430
[SPEAKER_01] things. Svemu se nadam.

1553
01:39:39,750 --> 01:39:40,710
[SPEAKER_00] I endure all things.

1554
01:39:40,950 --> 01:39:41,790
[SPEAKER_01] Sve podnosim.

1555
01:39:44,130 --> 01:39:45,390
[SPEAKER_00] Just pay attention to how that feels.

1556
01:39:46,170 --> 01:39:49,290
[SPEAKER_01] Slušajte kako to odzvanja.

1557
01:39:53,730 --> 01:39:58,890
[SPEAKER_00] So I mentioned to you, discovery of the wound, the root, is just the first step.

1558
01:39:59,370 --> 01:40:02,550
[SPEAKER_01] Otkrivanje korijena rane je samo prvi korak.

1559
01:40:04,050 --> 01:40:05,670
[SPEAKER_00] There is always more healing.

1560
01:40:06,750 --> 01:40:09,090
[SPEAKER_01] Postoji uvijek više ozdravljenja.

1561
01:40:09,630 --> 01:40:13,470
[SPEAKER_00] Why? Because there is more of Jesus's love constantly available.

1562
01:40:13,650 --> 01:40:17,730
[SPEAKER_01] Zato što je uvijek dostupno još više Isusove ljubavi.

1563
01:40:18,150 --> 01:40:21,090
[SPEAKER_00] Even at this conference, I had a radical healing of my own.

1564
01:40:21,390 --> 01:40:24,990
[SPEAKER_01] Čak i na toj konferenciji sam i ja imao jedno radikalno iskustvo ozdravljenja.

1565
01:40:25,230 --> 01:40:28,830
[SPEAKER_00] And a restoration in my relationship with my father.

1566
01:40:29,010 --> 01:40:31,590
[SPEAKER_01] I ozdravljenje u svom odnosu s Ocem.

1567
01:40:32,670 --> 01:40:33,930
[SPEAKER_00] I can't share about that today.

1568
01:40:34,290 --> 01:40:35,250
[SPEAKER_01] Ne mogu danas o tome.

1569
01:40:36,150 --> 01:40:39,270
[SPEAKER_00] But we came out of it knowing we were committed to the healing journey.

1570
01:40:39,750 --> 01:40:45,270
[SPEAKER_01] Ali izašli smo iz te konferencije znajući da se predajemo putovanju iscjeljenja.

1571
01:40:45,810 --> 01:40:48,390
[SPEAKER_00] And for us, it involved counseling.

1572
01:40:48,870 --> 01:40:52,290
[SPEAKER_01] Za nas je to uključivalo savjetovanje.

1573
01:40:52,650 --> 01:40:55,530
[SPEAKER_00] It involved many prayers and sessions of deliverance.

1574
01:40:55,770 --> 01:40:58,230
[SPEAKER_01] Puno molitvi oslobođenja i ozdravljenja.

1575
01:40:59,010 --> 01:41:02,430
[SPEAKER_00] But through it, we discovered the depths of God's love for us.

1576
01:41:02,550 --> 01:41:05,310
[SPEAKER_01] Ali kroz to smo otkrili bogatstvo Božje ljubavi za nas.

1577
01:41:05,430 --> 01:41:09,450
[SPEAKER_00] And we discovered the weight of what saying "I do" really means.

1578
01:41:09,870 --> 01:41:12,570
[SPEAKER_01] I otkrili smo što točno znači "da"

1579
01:41:14,430 --> 01:41:14,970
[SPEAKER_01] u braku.

1580
01:41:15,570 --> 01:41:18,930
[SPEAKER_00] So I want to make this practical for those of you that are married in this room.

1581
01:41:19,290 --> 01:41:23,070
[SPEAKER_01] Želim sad učiniti ovo sve praktičnim za one koji su ovdje vjenčani.

1582
01:41:23,670 --> 01:41:26,010
[SPEAKER_00] I want you to renew your commitment to your spouse.

1583
01:41:26,310 --> 01:41:30,390
[SPEAKER_01] Želim da obnovite svoje predanje svojoj suprugu ili supruzi.

1584
01:41:31,170 --> 01:41:34,830
[SPEAKER_00] So I'm going to lead you through the words that many of you have said on your wedding day.

1585
01:41:35,070 --> 01:41:39,030
[SPEAKER_01] Vodit ću vas kroz riječi koje ste izrekli na svom danu vjenčanja.

1586
01:41:39,390 --> 01:41:40,890
[SPEAKER_00] Many of you haven't said them since.

1587
01:41:41,310 --> 01:41:42,810
[SPEAKER_01] Mnogi ih od tad niste izrekli.

1588
01:41:44,550 --> 01:41:45,750
[SPEAKER_00] But here's what I want you to do.

1589
01:41:45,990 --> 01:41:47,010
[SPEAKER_01] Želim da ovo učinite.

1590
01:41:47,550 --> 01:41:51,510
[SPEAKER_00] If your spouse is here, I want you to turn to them and hold their hands in your hands.

1591
01:41:51,690 --> 01:41:55,530
[SPEAKER_01] Ako je vaš supružnik ili supruga ovdje, okrenite se i uzmite im ruku.

1592
01:41:55,890 --> 01:41:57,390
[SPEAKER_00] And I want you to look them in the eyes.

1593
01:41:57,570 --> 01:41:58,530
[SPEAKER_01] Gledajte ih u oči.

1594
01:41:59,070 --> 01:42:05,250
[SPEAKER_00] If they're not here, I want you to close your eyes and imagine them in front of you as if they were.

1595
01:42:05,430 --> 01:42:08,430
[SPEAKER_01] Ako niste ovdje, zatvorite oči i zamislite kao da su tu.

1596
01:42:10,230 --> 01:42:14,130
[SPEAKER_00] If you hope to be married and they're not here, just say this to your future spouse.

1597
01:42:14,550 --> 01:42:18,630
[SPEAKER_01] Ako se nadate da ćete se vjenčati, zatvorite oči i recite svom budućem supružniku.

1598
01:42:19,050 --> 01:42:21,270
[SPEAKER_00] If you're consecrated, say this to Jesus.

1599
01:42:21,750 --> 01:42:23,790
[SPEAKER_01] Ako ste posvećeni, recite to Isusu.

1600
01:42:27,090 --> 01:42:28,350
[SPEAKER_00] And just repeat this after me.

1601
01:42:28,470 --> 01:42:29,610
[SPEAKER_01] Ponavljajte ovo za mnom.

1602
01:42:30,210 --> 01:42:31,230
[SPEAKER_00] I, say your name.

1603
01:42:31,830 --> 01:42:33,210
[SPEAKER_01] Ja, recite svoje ime.

1604
01:42:33,990 --> 01:42:35,370
[SPEAKER_00] Take you, say their name.

1605
01:42:35,490 --> 01:42:37,470
[SPEAKER_01] Uzimam tebe, recite ime.

1606
01:42:38,010 --> 01:42:39,810
[SPEAKER_00] To be my wife or husband.

1607
01:42:39,930 --> 01:42:41,430
[SPEAKER_01] Da bude moj muž ili žena.

1608
01:42:42,930 --> 01:42:44,370
[SPEAKER_00] I promise to be true to you.

1609
01:42:45,150 --> 01:42:48,390
[SPEAKER_01] Obećajem ti vjernost.

1610
01:42:48,570 --> 01:42:49,950
[SPEAKER_00] In good times and in bad.

1611
01:42:50,190 --> 01:42:51,090
[SPEAKER_01] U dobru i u zlu.

1612
01:42:53,010 --> 01:42:54,510
[SPEAKER_00] In sickness and in health.

1613
01:42:54,810 --> 01:42:56,010
[SPEAKER_01] U zdravlju i bolesti.

1614
01:42:56,910 --> 01:42:58,650
[SPEAKER_00] I will love you and honor you.

1615
01:42:59,310 --> 01:43:00,810
[SPEAKER_01] Da ću te ljubiti i poštovati.

1616
01:43:01,710 --> 01:43:02,790
[SPEAKER_00] All the days of my life.

1617
01:43:02,970 --> 01:43:04,110
[SPEAKER_01] Sve dane života moga.
